AGEMENT_PANEL_VISIBILITY_HIDDEN"}},"attributedDescription":{"content":"The rugged SanDisk Extreme® Portable SSD delivers high‐speed storage for saving and editing hi‐res photos and videos. SHOP NOW: https://shop.westerndigital.com/produ...\n\nLearn more: https://www.sandisk.com/home/ssd/extr...\n\nSubscribe to SanDisk on YouTube:    / sandisk   \nFollow SanDisk on Twitter:   / sandisk   \nLike SanDisk on Facebook:   / sandisk   \nFollow SanDisk on Instagram:   / sandisk   \n\nThe rugged SanDisk Extreme Portable SSD delivers high‐speed transfers with up to 550MB/s read speeds, making it perfect for saving and editing hi‐res photos and videos. Its IP55 rating mean that it can stand up to rain, splashes, spills and dust. With up to 1TB capacity, it’s perfect for extensive photo shoots, taking your portfolio with you or backing up your work. Compact and designed to fit in the palm of your hand, the SanDisk Extreme Portable SSD works with both PC and Mac computers and comes with a 3‐year limited warranty. \n\nSanDisk Extreme Portable SSD | Official Product Overview","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":128,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CL0BEM2rARgBIhMIqZrgwMmJlgMVnRJjAR1FmwtnSM_B6uD0vcC-ogHKAQQkj4Ij","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rVHpxTlBSbWU2aTNKd3p2UE15QzFkM3xBR3JiS2FrNGd4RlVIdjhXeUxJT2ZmNDY1aEdPS1kzTkU5c200TkIzMTVkRjN6QS1fMzVqVldRUDdtTG9MU05fcFpROThDdW9oeVBXSjBRdzRPb1M0eUFZb0dWN0tlWEd0WE53\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fshop.westerndigital.com%2Fproducts%2Fportable-drives%2Fsandisk-extreme-usb-3-1-ssd%3Futm_medium%3Dpdvd2%26utm_source%3Dyt%26utm_campaign%3DYoutubeholiday2020%26utm_content%3DExtremePortableSSD%26utm_term%3D11-27-2020%23SDSSDE60-250G-G25\u0026v=on0B70waoM8","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rVHpxTlBSbWU2aTNKd3p2UE15QzF